{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-262", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/262", "wordCount": 996, "segments": [{"start": 6.0, "text": "Hi, I'm Tim Horton from the"}, {"start": 8.0, "text": "Safari and WebKit Team."}, {"start": 10.0, "text": "I'm here to show you how to"}, {"start": 11.0, "text": "present rich links in your app."}, {"start": 14.0, "text": "In iOS 10 and macOS Sierra, we"}, {"start": 17.0, "text": "introduced rich links in"}, {"start": 18.0, "text": "messages as a way to make URLs"}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "more beautiful and more useful."}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "In order to maximize the"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "benefit, we built"}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "specializations for certain"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "kinds of links."}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "This includes things like inline"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "video and audio playback, a"}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "special presentation for Tweets"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "including those with multiple"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "images and many other things"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "like Apple Maps links."}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "This year iOS 13 and macOS 10.15"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "bring new APIs that allow you to"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "present rich links in your own"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "apps so that you get those same"}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "benefits with a minimal amount"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "of work."}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "In this video, we're going to"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "follow the development of this"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "very simple recipe book marking"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "app as we progressively adopt"}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "features of the new link"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "presentation framework to go"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "from a bland list of URLs to a"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "rich grid of links like this in"}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "no time at all."}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "To achieve this I'm going to"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "cover 3 topics."}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "First, how to present metadata"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "given a URL."}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "Second, how to easily present"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "that metadata to the user."}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "And third, how to use fetched"}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "metadata to accelerate the"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "presentation of the new Share"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "Sheet experience in iOS 13."}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "So let's start with retrieving"}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "metadata."}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "In the recipe app, let's say"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "that you already have some"}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "mechanism for users to get URLs"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "into the app."}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "You could just present them in a"}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "table and call it quits, but"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "URLs are not very user-friendly"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "and in this case, it's quite"}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "hard to distinguish between"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "them."}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "You could instead ask the user"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "for a title for each link, but"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "we can make it even easier."}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "Using the new link presentation"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "framework it's very easy to use"}, {"start": 119.0, "text": "the LP metadata provider class"}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "to retrieve rich metadata from"}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "the website. You just pass it the URL and it"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "returns you an LPLinkMetadata"}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "object with a representative"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "title in any media that is"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "available."}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "Let's see what this looks like."}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "First you create an"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "LPMetadataProvider and then call"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "startFetchingMetadata with the"}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "URL you're interested in."}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "When the completion handler is"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "called, be sure to check the"}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "error."}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "If the server doesn't respond or"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "is too slow or your user doesn't"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "have a network connection, the"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "metadata fetched can fail."}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "Finally, you use the metadata"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "for whatever you want."}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "We'll come back to this in a moment."}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "Before we continue there are a"}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "few things to keep in mind when"}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "using metadataProvider and"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "LinkMetadata."}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "First, the resultant metadata"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "object can include any of a"}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "title, icon, image or video or"}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "none at all if the site doesn't"}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "specify any."}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "It is also serializable within a"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "secure coding."}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "This is important because"}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "LPMetadataProvider hits the"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "Internet to do its job and you"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "don't want to do that work nor"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "make your users pay that data"}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "and performance cost every time"}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "you present the same link."}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "You should cache retrieved"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "metadata locally as much as"}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "possible."}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "Also, you can fetch metadata for"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "local file URLs in which case"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "the new QuickLook thumbnailing"}, {"start": 206.0, "text": "API will be used to retrieve a"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "representative thumbnail for the"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "file, if possible."}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "Now let's talk about how to put"}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "the metadata we retrieve to use"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "by presenting it in our app."}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "Once again, it's"}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "straightforward."}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "You can just take the object"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "from earlier and create an"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "LPLinkView with it."}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "It's that simple."}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "Let's return to the recipe app"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "and put LPLinkViews inside our"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "table view cells."}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "Much better."}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "Now you have a very familiar"}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "presentation that makes each"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "recipe easy to identify at a"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "glance."}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "LPLinkView has an intrinsic"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "size, but it also responds to"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "size that fits with the ideal"}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "size to use given a constraining"}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "size and we'll try to present"}, {"start": 254.0, "text": "something reasonable when laid"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "out at any size."}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "The last thing I'm going to talk"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "about is how to make use of"}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "LinkMetadata to accelerate the"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "presentation of the new Share"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "Sheet experience in iOS 13."}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "For existing apps that share"}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "URLs, the Share Sheet will"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "automatically present a preview"}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "of the link at the top of the"}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "card."}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "However, this requires reaching"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "out to the server to retrieve"}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "metadata once the Share Sheet is"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "presented."}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "So the title and icon show up"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "asynchronously."}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "Let's watch that again."}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "Keep a close eye on the Share"}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "Sheet's header."}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "If you already have an"}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "LPLinkMetadata object for URL,"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "you should just pass it to the"}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "Share Sheet and the preview will"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "appear instantly without loading"}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "from the network."}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "You can use the new"}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "activityViewControllerLink"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "Metadata method on your"}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "implementation of"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "UIActivityItemSource and just"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "return the metadata object."}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "Let's look at the difference in"}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "our recipe app if we provide the"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "data that we already use in the"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "table view."}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "Much nicer."}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "It's also good to note that if"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "the user chooses to share to"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "messages the same metadata is"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "passed directly through"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "providing a smooth and seamless"}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "experience with no unnecessary"}, {"start": 329.0, "text": "loading."}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "One last thing."}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "Say your app already has a"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "database of recipes with titles"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "and images that weren't fetched"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "by linked presentation."}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "You don't have to re-fetch the"}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "metadata from the Internet in"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "order to accelerate the Share"}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "Sheet or to present a rich link."}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "Instead, you can just fill in"}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "the fields of LPLinkMetadata"}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "yourself from your pre-existing"}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "source of data."}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "You simply create an"}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "LPLinkMetadata object and fill"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "in at least the original URL and"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "URL fields plus whatever"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "additional information you have."}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "So our 3 key takeaways today are"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "you can use LP metadata provider"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "to fetch rich metadata for URL"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "in order to provide more context"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "about arbitrary URLs."}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "You should use LP link view to"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "present links in your app in a"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "way that is both beautiful and"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "consistent with the system and"}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "you should prefetch or use"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "existing LPLinkMetadata to"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "accelerate the Share Sheet"}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "preview in your app."}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "For more information visit"}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "developer.apple.com."}]}
